      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, but i'm super busy with work and honestly i'm kinda scared to go to the doctor and have them tell me i need surgery or something. i've done heavy stretching before when i had a pulled muscle and it helped a lot. isnt it possible it's just a tight muscle that's pressing on the nerve? wouldn't some aggressive stretching or even a massage help loosen things up instead of waiting weeks for an appointment?",
